=2 Walkthrough
* You'll need to zone again if you haven't done so yet after receiving {p:Bouncer Club}.
* Talk to {n:Kohlo-Lakolo} for a cut scene to start the quest.
* Head to {z:Windurst Waters}(South) (a short walk away, or use Home Point #3) and speak to {n:Honoi-Gomoi} - (E-7) for a cut scene.
** He is upstairs in his house, which is accessed through a back stairway.
* Get a {i:Star Spinel|Star Spinel|1149} from {m:Spelunking Sabotender} in {z:Quicksand Caves}.
** Enter Quicksand Caves through the entrance in {z:Western Altepa Desert} at (G-5). Spelunking Sabotender can be found in the passageway near (F-7).
** There are also a couple spawns by Home Point #1.
** {s:Sneak} is required even at level 99.
** An Ornate Door blocks the way and can be opened via the weight pads nearby. The weight pad requires a certain number of players to stand on it:
*** 1 {p:Galka}
*** Any 2 of {p:Hume}, {p:Elvaan}, or {p:Mithra}
*** 3 {p:Tarutaru}
*** Any 1 player after completing {q:Open Sesame|Open Sesame|Open Sesame}
* Bring the {i:Star Spinel|Star Spinel|1149} to {n:Honoi-Gomoi}, who will reward you with the {i:Star Necklace|Star Necklace|13136} after a cut scene.
* Talk to {n:Kohlo-Lakolo} for a cut scene, and then once again back to {n:Honoi-Gomoi} for a cut scene to complete the quest.

